      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "How javva deallocates dynamic blocks\n==================================\n\nIn java dynamic blocks like array and objects are created using new keyword.\n\n1.Garbage block.\n2.Garbage collector.",
